### tensor core operation

Fundamental operation: $D = A \times B + C$

Where:

- $A$: $M \times K$ matrix
- $B$: $K \times N$ matrix
- $C$: $M \times N$ matrix (accumulator)
- $D$: $M \times N$ matrix (result)

Warp-level matrix multiply-accumulate (WMMA):

```cuda
